age","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"同時押しがバラ打ちになるのは気合でなんとかなるんですが、その逆がどうも無理だなと","ts":"1634008235.300600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NANl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58419d1f-f35d-43c5-8f89-c8978b0ab87f","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"emacs ないのddskk nicola は大丈夫なんだけど","ts":"1634007827.299800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tU1sZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9bd4b3a8-3b81-44f7-bdab-d0ebaca57eff","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ibus-skkは確かに厳しかった。乗り換えた位でバグレポートも","ts":"1634007769.298800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tsurai_orange","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tvMnr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f18c9288-2be0-46e6-9151-4ecfbd25c639","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"自分は気を抜かないでタイピングするのが好みなので大丈夫。","ts":"1634007735.297800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f/1w7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6cb9cb4-4d6f-4ec0-a390-632155545123","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"まー完全に好みですよね、あと同時押しミスによる誤爆は実際多い、、、\n気を抜いてるとすーぐバラ打ち判定になる","ts":"1634007704.297000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5F/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6556dc6e-5418-4370-88ba-dbcd94b3c5eb","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"あ、もしかして同時打鍵の判定の調整が合ってなくて誤字入力の話でしたか？","ts":"1634007698.296800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QYjU6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ce43bc8-f8bf-4d5c-95ce-71f6f679c40f","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"あと、変換、無変換にvimに何もわりあててない。","ts":"1634007452.294300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FwUB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"63eb4545-d4f4-4dd8-bb3d-7849ab1912fa","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"ibus-anthy のnicola のvimインサーモード時nicola してるが、ctrl + j で半角と全角を切り替えているし、esc 抜けしないとvimの操作と干渉しないが、カスタマイズの違いか。","ts":"1634007253.292200","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1634007298.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"snsJW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eae3738a-4c71-4b54-94a6-1f795d1fc669","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"入力のタイミングに気を遣わない、無理ではという気持ちがある。。","ts":"1634007240.291800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xsZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ded8c55f-1aac-469b-aa5c-bed3b17f21ca","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"qwertyがクソというのには同意","ts":"1634006927.290500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T2Efa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b67f047a-5edc-4acd-a40d-885c2597be28","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"SandSとかもそうだけど入力のタイミングなんて物に気を遣いたくないんだよな","ts":"1634006918.290100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HWs2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0ad21de2-93a9-4e31-897e-4aa7c8fa7513","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"個人的には速さよりも、英字入力配列に合わせて日本語入力をするっていうのが気に食わないという宗教上の理由かな。\n日本語には日本語のための配列を使いたい。qwertyとかいう不本意な配列を使いたくないのと同じマインド。","ts":"1634006584.287400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1LJQ+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8d8303ea-f525-44fe-97dd-8ad8404677e1","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"同時押し誤入力削減は気合です","ts":"1634006509.286400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CBTkl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7be2ca25-1348-4f6f-8a45-5d818c64c29f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"何よりVimで使えない","ts":"1634006281.284400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_ori